      <H1 class=contentheading>CITY OF NAWABS Yellow Page </H1>
      <P class=standard><B>Welcome to yellow page. </B><BR class="">
        <BR 
      class="">
         yellow page for Lucknow established its Indian operations in the year 2010, making it 
      the first Multinational Express company to set up operations in India on 
      its own. Headquartered in Lucknow,city of nawabs yellow page has the pride of owning the 
      widest range of searching entity for Lucknow related information. 
      <P class=standard>      <BR 
      class="">
          In line with its global strategy of setting up high quality 
        networks in emerging markets,city of nawabs Yellow page forayed into the domestic express 
        segment in February 2010. This launch made TNT the first multi-national 
        brand to offer international and domestic services using an integrated air 
        and road network. <BR class="">
        <BR class="">
        In September 2010, TNT India 
        acquired Speedage, one of the leading road express companies in India. 
        This acquisition not only offered a powerful platform for further 
        expansion in the fast growing Indian express market but also positioned it 
        as one of the top 3 players in the Indian domestic road express segment. <BR class="">
        <BR class="">
        Today, TNT India, has a pick-up and delivery 
        setup spanning across 600 offices, 2000 vehicles, 34 hubs, 592 depots and 
        sortation centers. Our operational networks are supported by sophisticated 
        technology which as well as ensuring service reliability provides 
        real-time, on-line information about the status of your consignments. <BR 
      class="">
        <BR class="">
        City of nawabs yellow Page Advantage <BR class="">
      <UL>
        <LI>One-stop-shop offering a comprehensive range of domestic and 
        international services <BR class="">
        <LI>24x7 customer helpline <BR class="">
        <LI>24-hour online track &amp; trace systems for consignments <BR 
        class="">
        <LI>SA 8000, ISO 140001, ISO 9001 and IiP certified - the highest number 
        of accreditations in the industry keeping us way ahead of competition in 
        terms of process, people, health &amp; safety and environmental 
        standards. <BR class="">
        <LI>Global network with local expertise <BR class=""></LI></UL><BR 
      class=""><B><BR class="">Products &amp; Services </B><BR class=""><BR 
      class="">TNT's central philosophy places the customer at the heart of its 
      business. It is an adherence to this philosophy reflected in providing 
